# ── ML / Data ────────────────────────────────────────
# The seed CSVs, the parquet feature store and the trained model artefacts
# ARE committed (~2.4 MB total) so that a fresh clone runs
# `docker compose up` with no bootstrap step and reproduces the exact
# metrics recorded in ml/MODEL_CARD.md.
#
# NOTE: these are file-pattern excludes, not directory excludes — git cannot
# re-include a path underneath an excluded directory, so `data/mock/` etc.
# must NOT be listed here.
*.h5
*.joblib

*.csv
!Assets/*.csv
!data/mock/*.csv
!data/ethiopia/**/*.csv

*.pkl
!ml/models/*.pkl
!data/processed/*.pkl

*.parquet
!data/processed/*.parquet
!data/ethiopia/**/*.parquet

# ── Runtime logs ─────────────────────────────────────
# Written by the running API (leftover placement evaluator). Never committed.
data/monitoring/*.jsonl

# ── OS ───────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

